{
  "doc": "The pure logic modules TScert checks (docs/REFACTOR.md §1, functional core). Each area: a glob (relative to the repo) and the tsconfig TScert reads it with (relative to the repo). scripts/tscert-ratchet.mjs; tscert/README.md.",
